stateDiagram-v2
    %% Figure D6. Operational Document State Machine & Cryptographic Gates

    [*] --> Borrador: Ingest raw text<br/>(POST /v2/documents/ingest)
    note right of Borrador
        Canonicalized text and SHA-256 hash
        stored in outputs/experiments/.../sources/
    end note

    Borrador --> Analizado: Epistemic extraction<br/>(POST /v2/documents/{id}/extract)

    Analizado --> EvaluatingType: Operational structuring<br/>(POST /v2/documents/{id}/structure)

    state EvaluatingType <<choice>>
    EvaluatingType --> ApprovalPending: tipo_caso == 'puro'
    EvaluatingType --> Requiere_Revision: tipo_caso == 'conflicto' or ambiguity

    state Requiere_Revision {
        [*] --> HumanReview: review_status = 'pending'<br/>requires_human_review = true<br/>selected_alternative = null
        HumanReview --> Resolution: Investigator selects alternative and notes rationale
        HumanReview --> Rechazado: Investigator rejects proposal
    }

    state ApprovalPending {
        [*] --> AwaitingSignature: review_status = 'not_required'<br/>Syntactic validation OK
    }

    AwaitingSignature --> Aprobado: Human approval<br/>(POST /v2/documents/{id}/approve)
    Resolution --> Aprobado: Approval with alternative<br/>(POST /v2/documents/{id}/approve)

    note right of Aprobado
        Immutable Cryptographic Seal:
        Canonical SHA-256 hash (11 fields) computed
        and recorded in approval_metadata.approved_json_hash
    end note

    Aprobado --> Generado_YAML: Generate YAMLs<br/>(POST /v2/documents/{id}/generate-yaml)<br/>assert_yaml_generation_allowed verification
    note right of Generado_YAML
        GoalSpec and PlanSpec YAMLs
        written to outputs/.../yaml/
        with traceability header
    end note

    Generado_YAML --> Instalado_Sandbox: Install in Sandbox<br/>(POST /v2/experiments/{id}/install)
    note right of Instalado_Sandbox
        Creates .tar.gz backup in backups/
        Installs into EthosTerra_experiment
        (EthosTerra_original remains untouched)
    end note

    Instalado_Sandbox --> [*]
    Rechazado --> [*]

    %% Blocking Transitions
    Borrador --> Block_403: Direct attempt to generate YAML<br/>[Document not approved]
    Analizado --> Block_403: Direct attempt to generate YAML<br/>[Document not approved]
    Requiere_Revision --> Block_403: Attempt without selected alternative<br/>[selected_alternative == null]
    Aprobado --> Block_Tampering_403: Post-approval JSON tampering<br/>[current_hash ≠ approved_json_hash]

    state Block_403 {
        [*] --> HTTP_403_Forbidden: YAMLGenerationBlocked<br/>Security gate denies generation
    }

    state Block_Tampering_403 {
        [*] --> HTTP_403_Tamper: Cryptographic Integrity Violation<br/>Recalculated hash mismatches signature
    }
